  "scope": "Real SDK connection-scoped subscriptions enforce catalog/template validation, FIFO changes, limits and sanitized failures. Real stdio notifications refresh a literal preview serially without starving completed results, manual insertion stays available during continuous updates and makes no model request. Actual unsubscribe filters a delayed notification; Unicode selection, disconnect/reconnect, unsupported capabilities, normal restart/draft retention and dark native Tab access at 100/125/150% zoom pass in the complete 200-check source suite. The previous full source starvation failure and two failing controlled tests remain independent negative evidence. A separate full-suite failure at a zero-second one-shot input was reproduced in the actual Electron input: browser normalization retains the identical timestamp but Playwright rejects the non-canonical string. The fixture uses native canonical formatting and asserts the persisted timestamp, retaining the original four-second wall-clock execution and original wait. The hosted temporary completion cause remains unknown; bounded last-poll diagnostics retain its original deadline/predicate. New package and hosted verification remain separate required gates."
}
